# AI-BEM-Workflow

Official repository for the paper:

**An AI-assisted workflow for generative building design and energy modeling:
Converting natural language design intent and images into 3D building energy model inputs**

Shikang Wen and Qingyan Chen  
*Advanced Engineering Informatics*

## Repository contents

This repository contains the resources associated with the study, including:

- Synthetic building dataset
- GraphSAGE-based building component segmentation
- Mesh-to-EnergyPlus conversion workflow
- Evaluation scripts and example cases
